hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"335","We are Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, we are Sufyan, we are Al-Zuhri. H Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al Makhzoumi and Ahmad bin Abdah narrated to us, saying: Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Salem, on the authority of His father, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The one who misses the afternoon prayer is as if he is taking care of his family and his wealth.” Malik said: its interpretation The passing of time"
